                                                "sense_id": "a9fa539e-3409-3833-b186-eb14df786ed6",
                                                "text": "Goodbye. I am going to the great grey-green, greasy Limpopo River, all set about with fever-trees, to find out what the Crocodile has for dinner."
                                            }
